that's your department.

1355
00:56:59.260 --> 00:57:00.710
Okay.
Am I right, Bob?

1356
00:57:00.770 --> 00:57:02.750
Alice, let's just
call this quits.

1357
00:57:02.800 --> 00:57:04.440
And I will call you
