1358
00:57:04.600 --> 00:57:06.240
Hey, babe, I quits, okay?

1359
00:57:06.410 --> 00:57:08.580
Because you cheated on me
with the fancy stylish woman.

1360
00:57:08.740 --> 00:57:11.220
